  "alt": "The governance lifecycle spans context compilation, policy resolution, and verification gating.",
  "text": [
    "Vendor Projections: CLAUDE.md (< 300 LOC), .cursor/rules/*.mdc, .github/copilot-instructions.md, .windsurfrules, .gemini/GEMINI.md, .codex/rules.md.",
    "Boxes: AGENTS.md (Canonical Source), praetorctl compile-context, .standards.yaml (& .standards.lock), Effective Policy (Lattice Supremum), .devcontainer & Toolchain, praetorctl audit, praetorctl plan, praetorctl gate run, Gate stages, Ed25519 Exit-0 receipt.",
    "AGENTS.md → praetorctl compile-context → CLAUDE.md.",
    "praetorctl compile-context → .cursor/rules/*.mdc.",
